zen who allegedly acted alone, as he wore a military-style uniform with a bulletproof vest and used a military-type long gun in the attack.\r\n\r\nvia THE EPOCH TIMES---------\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s been reported the shooter, Michal Oskinski, killed his family before heading into the city centre - \r\n\r\nBetting this is another Mind Virus Internet created  Tranny.", "author": "Bullet3250", "created": 1794151941319, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "OrangeManBadasss", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Rumored... Poland shooter\u2019s bio is full of pride imagery.", "last_comment_created": 1794155741953, "content": "<p>Shooting at Poland Market Kills at Least 6\nThe shooting happened at Main Market Square, an urban area full of caf\u00e9s, hotels, and museums.</p>\n<p>A gunman allegedly fired shots from a moving car just after 3 p.m. local time at Main Market Square, an urban area in the southern city of Krak\u00f3w.</p>\n<p>The attack happened on S\u0142awkowska Street, a tourist hotspot in the northern corner of Main Market Square, about a quarter of a mile long, lined with caf\u00e9s, hotels, and museums.</p>\n<p>At least 15 people were injured in the shooting. The severity of their injuries is not known.</p>\n<p>The suspect is a 24-year-old Polish citizen who allegedly acted alone, as he wore a military-style uniform with a bulletproof vest and used a military-type long gun in the attack.</p>\n<p>via THE EPOCH TIMES---------</p>\n<p>It\u2019s been reported the shooter, Michal Oskinski, killed his family before heading into the city centre -</p>\n<p>Betting this is another Mind Virus Internet created  Tranny.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_